          <!-- 1. INTRODUCTION -->
          <section id="introduction" class="docs-section">
            <div class="docs-section-header">
              <span class="docs-section-tag">Getting Started</span>
              <h2 class="docs-h1">Introduction</h2>
            </div>

            <p class="docs-lead">
              ProxEve is an AI API caching proxy designed to reduce unnecessary AI provider requests by serving eligible repeated requests from cache.
            </p>

            <p class="docs-p">
              Modern applications frequently submit identical or semantically duplicate prompts to large language models (LLMs), incurring per-token costs and unnecessary network latency. ProxEve sits between your application and upstream AI providers, inspecting incoming prompts, evaluating cache rules, and delivering sub-millisecond responses for cached requests.
            </p>

            <!-- Architecture Diagram Component (Styled HTML Boxes) -->
            <div class="arch-diagram-wrapper">
              <div class="arch-diagram-title">ProxEve High-Level Architecture</div>
              <div class="arch-flow-row">

